      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Brentin and his team conducted themselves exceptionally, from our initial conversation, right through to the end of the project. Before the first day of the installation, I changed my mind a few times with what solar panels I wanted to go with. Brentin was patient with my questions and was very helpful giving good information in the planning stage.All up, I am very happy with all the components, the workmanship and the quality of the system as a whole. Brentin and his team, maintained good communications, were punctual and all the paperwork was done to a very high standard.At the time of install, Brentin organised the meter change with the correct energy authority. Unfortunately, there was a mix up, which was not Brentin's (or CSS) fault, it was the energy retailer's fault. Eventually, the energy retailer, i.e. Ergon, did sort it out, however, it took many hours talking with them on the phone to finally fix it up (i.e. change the old wheel (AKA spin meter), to the new, two-way smart meter). This did not happen until about two months after the solar system was installed.All in all, I highly recommend Central Solar Services.",
